        {
          "text": " Aha kiro kya ikumi eky'okwo kwezi kwa mushanju mugume mugire okuteerana okurikwera; ahari eryo izooba mwebonabonese, mutaririkoreraho omurimo gwona ogurikurusya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.7",
