        {
          "text": " Kandi aha kiro kya ikumi na bitaano omuri okwo kwezi kwa mushanju muryaguma mugire okuteerana okurikwera; mutarikikoreraho omurimo gwona ogurikurusya; kandi muryamara ebiro mushanju nimurinda obugyenyi bw'ebiro bikuru ahari MUKAMA. ",
